    question: "With reference to the chemical herbicide 'Paraquat' and its regulatory status in India, consider the following statements:\n1. Paraquat is a non-selective contact herbicide that kills green plant tissue by generating reactive oxygen species (ROS) during photosynthesis.\n2. It has no known medical antidote, and human ingestion often leads to irreversible, fatal pulmonary fibrosis.\n3. The Rotterdam Convention on the Prior Informed Consent Procedure has placed a mandatory, global commercial production ban on all paraquat formulations.\nWhich of the statements given above are correct?",
